# ============================================================
# FILE OVERVIEW: .gitignore
# ============================================================
# Lists files and folders that Git should NOT track or upload to GitHub.
# Each line is a name or pattern. Lines starting with # are comments.

# Claude Code's local settings for this project (the preview server setup).
# It's only useful on this computer, so it stays out of the repository.
.claude/

# VS Code's settings for this project (for example, how to launch Chrome for testing).
# Like the folder above, it's only useful on this computer.
.vscode/
